<title>UK: UK's Davis sells unit to Sutcliffe.</title>
<headline>UK's Davis sells unit to Sutcliffe.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Davis Service Group Plc said on Wednesday it had sold the public service business of its subsidiary Pall Mall Service Group Ltd (PMSG) to Sutcliffe Catering (UK) Ltd for 8.4 million stg.</p>
<p>Davis said it would use the sale proceeds to reduce debt and will retain the private sector business of PMSG. A further payment of up to 1.8 million stg is also payable if PMSG is awarded certain contracts.</p>
<p>Sutcliffe is a unit of Granada Food Services.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
